message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ACE-Inhibitory Peptide Predictor"
abstract: >-
  A web server that predicts whether a peptide inhibits angiotensin-converting
  enzyme (IC50 < 50 micromolar), using an extremely randomised trees classifier
  trained on 879 sequence descriptors.
